            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Atomic swap: Funded contract replacement. Categories: Atomic swap. Weaknesses: CWE-841."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Atomic swap: Funded contract replacement. Categories: Atomic swap. Weaknesses: CWE-841.\n\n## Remediation\n\nTreat an identical retransmission as idempotent and reject changed contracts or participant keys after a funding broadcast, observed funding, or either-leg commitment. Bind each funding record to its actual scriptPubKey and validate that binding before signing.",
                "text": "Atomic swap: Funded contract replacement. Categories: Atomic swap. Weaknesses: CWE-841.\n\nRemediation:\n\nTreat an identical retransmission as idempotent and reject changed contracts or participant keys after a funding broadcast, observed funding, or either-leg commitment. Bind each funding record to its actual scriptPubKey and validate that binding before signing."
              },
              "id": "atomic-swap.funded-contract-replacement",
              "name": "Atomic swap: Funded contract replacement",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "tags": [
                  "atomic-swap",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-841",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Atomic swap: Funded contract replacement"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Atomic swap: Incomplete zenon expectations. Categories: Atomic swap. Weaknesses: CWE-754."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Atomic swap: Incomplete zenon expectations. Categories: Atomic swap. Weaknesses: CWE-754.\n\n## Remediation\n\nRequire a pinned recipient before verifying an incoming Zenon leg or exposing a secret. For records created with a blank address, explicitly bind the intended recipient from the connected wallet and reverify the HTLC before permitting unlock.",
                "text": "Atomic swap: Incomplete zenon expectations. Categories: Atomic swap. Weaknesses: CWE-754.\n\nRemediation:\n\nRequire a pinned recipient before verifying an incoming Zenon leg or exposing a secret. For records created with a blank address, explicitly bind the intended recipient from the connected wallet and reverify the HTLC before permitting unlock."
              },
              "id": "atomic-swap.incomplete-zenon-expectations",
              "name": "Atomic swap: Incomplete zenon expectations",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "tags": [
                  "atomic-swap",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-754",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Atomic swap: Incomplete zenon expectations"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Atomic swap: Insufficient bitcoin payment. Categories: Atomic swap. Weaknesses: CWE-841."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Atomic swap: Insufficient bitcoin payment. Categories: Atomic swap. Weaknesses: CWE-841.\n\n## Remediation\n\nEnforce Funding.Value >= AmountSats in the core before any first preimage disclosure or counter-leg commitment. Make Auto Mode wait on that invariant; preserve an explicitly separate recovery path for reclaiming a partial payment without silently releasing an unrevealed secret.",
                "text": "Atomic swap: Insufficient bitcoin payment. Categories: Atomic swap. Weaknesses: CWE-841.\n\nRemediation:\n\nEnforce Funding.Value >= AmountSats in the core before any first preimage disclosure or counter-leg commitment. Make Auto Mode wait on that invariant; preserve an explicitly separate recovery path for reclaiming a partial payment without silently releasing an unrevealed secret."
              },
              "id": "atomic-swap.insufficient-bitcoin-payment",
              "name": "Atomic swap: Insufficient bitcoin payment",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "tags": [
                  "atomic-swap",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-841",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Atomic swap: Insufficient bitcoin payment"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Atomic swap: Nonminimal contract push. Categories: Atomic swap. Weaknesses: CWE-20."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Atomic swap: Nonminimal contract push. Categories: Atomic swap. Weaknesses: CWE-20.\n\n## Remediation\n\nRebuild the canonical contract from parsed fields and require byte-for-byte equality, or enforce canonical push opcodes at every dynamic position. Add malformed-push cases for each branch and verify accepted scripts remain redeemable and refundable under StandardVerifyFlags.",
                "text": "Atomic swap: Nonminimal contract push. Categories: Atomic swap. Weaknesses: CWE-20.\n\nRemediation:\n\nRebuild the canonical contract from parsed fields and require byte-for-byte equality, or enforce canonical push opcodes at every dynamic position. Add malformed-push cases for each branch and verify accepted scripts remain redeemable and refundable under StandardVerifyFlags."
              },
              "id": "atomic-swap.nonminimal-contract-push",
              "name": "Atomic swap: Nonminimal contract push",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "tags": [
